cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FaultLine: risk-calibrated joint telemetry-text sequence modeling for cyber-physical event risk under shift"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Erniyazov
    given-names: Sarvarbek
    affiliation: "Chonnam National University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sarvarbek-Erniyazov/FaultLine"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-09"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch decoder-only sequence model over a joint vocabulary of byte-level BPE
  text tokens and per-channel quantile-bin telemetry tokens, targeting calibrated event
  risk with selective abstention for wind-turbine SCADA under site, modality and
  temporal shift. Status: M0 -- skeleton, data pipelines and data staging only.
keywords:
  - sequence modeling
  - risk calibration
  - selective prediction
  - wind energy
  - SCADA
